data: {"event": "run.completed", "run_id": "run_5b2b0dad640147d7b936c42b3f1bf762", "timestamp": 1789916558.147653, "output": "Looking at your memory, I see the relevant context:\n\n- **Local LLM Lab milestones** go to `#llm-tinkering`; EXP-019 Ornith-GGUF work is already done (winners Q6_K llama.cpp 0.4.1 + Q8_0 KV @64K, launcher ~/.hermes/bin/local-ornith, profile local-ornith; 12.4-12.7 tok/s decode, Hermes cold 78.5s @11K, warm 4.7s @99% cache, needle correct thru 61.9K, Q5 rejected at 119 t/s prefill, >35K populated not comfortable).\n- **Lanes** (09-16): FAST = Ornith-1.5-9B-4bit at port 8901, DEEP = Bonsai-27B at port 8902, manager at ~/.hermes/bin/hermes-local-model. Never run local inference for easy tasks \u2014 Mac unusable; ask first.\n- **Current model**: minicpm5-2b, provider: custom, platform: api_server, host macOS 27.0.\n\nThe intermittent \"connection refused\" on a localhost HTTP service usually has two plausible causes. Here's the evidence-led order to check:\n\n**1. Port binding / service process**\n- Confirm the host port is actually listening on the expected port (e.g., 8901 for FAST, 8902 for DEEP). A process may have died mid-cycle and the socket not cleaned up.\n- Verify the launcher (`~/.hermes/bin/local-ornith`, `~/.hermes/bin/hermes-local-model`) is still resident and not swapped.\n\n**2. Model lane identity / provider mismatch**\n- The current model is `minicpm5-2b` with `provider: custom`. If the HTTP service expects the `Bonsai-27B` (DEEP lane) at port 8902 but the resident lane is something else, connection refused can surface because the service isn't routing the request to the right lane.\n- Confirm the model is actually resident in its lane (not swapped to a cloud/default lane) and the provider tag matches what the service expects.\n\nThe next smallest, most likely experiment: check that the host port is alive and that the resident lane matches the service's expectation. If that's fine and still refused, then the model/lane identity is the next variable to probe.", "usage": {"input_tokens": 14444, "output_tokens": 524, "total_tokens": 14968}}

